5B6AC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Lethal Ape Resurrection", "keywords": ["lethalape", "horror", "game", "vr"], "long_description": "Lethal Ape Resurrection  a virtual reality horror game that drops players into a dark, abandoned warehouse filled with mystery, danger, and primal fear. Designed for VR platforms and utilizing gorilla-style locomotion made popular by games like Gorilla Tag, Lethal Ape offers a unique blend of physical movement and psychological terror that pushes the limits of immersive horror gaming. In Lethal Ape, you take on the role of an ape-like creature navigating a pitch-black industrial facility where something sinister is stalking you. You have no weapons\u2014only your wits and the ability to move through the environment with speed and agility. The game\u2019s core movement system is entirely arm-driven, meaning you must run, jump, and climb using realistic arm swings. This creates an intense physical connection to the game world and amplifies the sense of vulnerability and tension as you try to evade an unseen predator.\nThe atmosphere in Lethal Ape Resurrection  is thick with dread. Dim lighting, ambient sounds, and sudden encounters create a constant feeling of being hunted. Every shadow could be hiding danger, and every step might be your last. The game\u2019s visual and audio design work together to create an overwhelming sense of immersion, making each moment feel suspenseful and unpredictable.", "short_description": "Lethal Ape Resurrection is a free VR horror game series that immerses players in the role of an ape navigating through dark, industrial environments teeming with lurking dangers. Inspired by the movement mechanics of Gorilla Tag, the game utilizes gorilla-style locomotion swinging arms to run and climb enhancing the sense of immersion and urgency."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/166b6377-8b53-41e0-abd4-d8dbc